{
  "_readme": [
    "Terminology for the `en` locale. These are closed vocabularies: every",
    "distinct terminal name and facility label in the dataset must appear here or",
    "`npm run db:seed` fails with the list of missing entries. Gate ranges are",
    "translated by pattern in scripts/seed.mjs (廊 -> Concourse, 厅 -> Hall), and",
    "the seed fails if any CJK characters survive that pass.",
    "Free editorial text (airline lists, ground-transport names and descriptions)",
    "is intentionally absent: those columns stay NULL for English and the UI falls",
    "back to locale-neutral data. Add them under `airlines` / `transit` to",
    "localize that copy without touching any code."
  ],
